# Axit project tracking

- Public repository: https://github.com/wckdboy/axit. Website: https://axit.sh.
- Plane workspace: `wckd`; project: `Axit` / `AXIT`;
  project id: `21757fa0-759f-4ce5-a114-4620fd693302`.
- Keep the root README current with shipped behavior, installation, controls,
  supported platforms, meaningful validation and the near-term roadmap.
- Update the relevant Plane work items when work begins, scope changes or
  verified work ships. Link commits, PRs, checks and releases as evidence.
- Mark a work item or release complete only after the required checks and
  publication/deployment have succeeded. Record unresolved limitations honestly.
- For a release, update the README, GitHub release notes and Plane release
  together. Preserve planned work as backlog instead of implying it has shipped.
- Follow the standard `site/` Wrangler workflow for axit.sh and update its
  installer mirror through the root `install.sh` source.
